          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Features",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "useRawFormat": true,
          "markdown": "<style>ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;}li{line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:12px;}</style><ul><li><b>Native gesture navigation</b> — swipe up to go Home, swipe and hold to open the App Switcher, and swipe along the bottom edge to jump between apps</li><li><b>Face ID-style status bar</b> — the modern iPhone X layout with the clock on the left and Control Center access from the top-right corner</li><li><b>Lock Screen Quick Actions</b> — Flashlight and Camera buttons right on the Lock Screen</li></ul>"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Compatibility",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Supported on **iPhone 8**, **iPhone 8 Plus**, **iPhone SE (2020)** and **iPhone SE (2022)** running **iOS 16.0 – 16.7.16**."
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Settings",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Gestures16 has no settings yet — the only option is to turn it on or off. More customization is planned for future updates."
        },
